[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16381.269, "timestamp": "04:33:01", "text": "因为如果我不在了，那这一切还有什么意义呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16384.31, "timestamp": "04:33:04", "text": "值得吗？或者像我不值得的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16387.51, "timestamp": "04:33:07", "text": "呃，更确切地说，该怎么称呼它呢？是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16389.31, "timestamp": "04:33:09", "text": "当我状态不好的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16392.709, "timestamp": "04:33:12", "text": "够了吗？更像是他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16395.349, "timestamp": "04:33:15", "text": "我从没做过。我以前也这样做过"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16397.349, "timestamp": "04:33:17", "text": "停止。我觉得那是勉强的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16400.31, "timestamp": "04:33:20", "text": "晋升之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16403.429, "timestamp": "04:33:23", "text": "是升职之类的。我是强迫自己"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16405.99, "timestamp": "04:33:25", "text": "人或其他什么东西。然后我感到很难过。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16409.709, "timestamp": "04:33:29", "text": "有一天，我哭了。我当时就想，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16413.349, "timestamp": "04:33:33", "text": "“好的。”是的。我不会这么做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16414.99, "timestamp": "04:33:34", "text": "我还是忘了这件事吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16418.59, "timestamp": "04:33:38", "text": "它。我不知道。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16421.75, "timestamp": "04:33:41", "text": "哑的。我爸刚刚发了条信息。我需要去"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 16432.727, "timestamp": "04:33:52", "author": "@bakononcopiumm", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/hb5sPAHLUD7fBrZZsmfkzISQWwRqI8BY1n8lceyhZz0sNISomD05pCwUe-GL2amD5y-voH_uYw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "i mean when you do yt for a long time, you will realize it just about acting too"}]